  "historyNote": "#2039, eff 7-1-82; ss by #2423, eff 7-13-83; rpld by #2468, eff 9-6-83 New. #3051, eff 7-8-85, EXPIRED: 7-8-91 New. #7281, eff 5-23-00, EXPIRED: 5-23-08 New. #9512 eff 7-9-09; ss by #12409, eff 10-24-17",
